From u99a06696c483481a at groups.google.com  Wed Mar 11 19:15:49 2015
From: u99a06696c483481a at groups.google.com (Edward Rigdon)
Date: Wed, 11 Mar 2015 19:15:49 +0000
Subject: RE: reflective first order, formative second order model
Message-ID: <kJchh6AQQk8.j3YctRiCqwoJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
